"A call of a procedure a local names: FX-26 takes its latent effect, and
 says spin only where its type is recursive through a parameter; KFX says
 spin for every such call, not following which types are."
(define-effect kfx (maxeff (read @globals) spin))
(define twice (subr pure ((subr pure (i64) i64) i64) i64) (lambda (f x) (f (f x))))
(twice (lambda ((x i64)) (i64+ x 1)) 1)
